# Stream M: gpt-oss:20b on the local Mac (Apple M4 Pro, 48 GB, Ollama 0.40.5 at 11434), Kev from GPU job A (8008). The cluster's full GPUs were all taken, and a local open-weights model is the deployment we argue for.
